cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Hakuli in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Hakuli: Memory-Efficient Full-Parameter LLM Training without SVD"
abstract: >-
  Hakuli is a PyTorch optimizer for full-parameter training and fine-tuning of
  large language models with SGD-like optimizer memory and AdamW-level quality.
  It approximates channel-wise gradient scaling from a low-rank Gaussian random
  projection and performs no singular value decomposition at any step.
type: software
